/** "Build a custom server" configuration, resolved server-side once per page
 *  (lib/custom-plan.ts customPlanFloor/Ceiling/Rates) — the same numbers
 *  quoteCustomPlanAction and createCustomPlan re-validate against. The wizard
 *  uses them for slider bounds and an instant PREVIEW price only; the
